    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">An ancient curse sends a stone silo crashing across the countryside.  Houses, barns, and cars are crushed in its path.  The silo contains a giant scroll, sent by the foul Spellbinder to imprison the entire earth within its vast, unrolling page.  Even the mighty Librarian is overpowered by the Spellbinder&apos;s steamrolling magic.  Can anyone stop the smashing scroll?</marc:subfield>
